        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Discwoman\n- Places: New York\n- Topics: electronic music community, genderqueer identity, gender expression\n\nFacts:\n- Discwoman is a New York-based collective, booking agency, and event platform.\n- Discwoman represents and showcases female-identified talent in the electronic music community, including cis women, transwomen, and gender queer people.\n- Genderqueer people may express a combination of masculinity and femininity in their gender expression.\n- Genderqueer people may also express neither masculinity nor femininity in their gender expression.",
